  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EMPOWERING HER: Advancing Women&apos;s Economic and Political Leadership</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering Her: Advancing Women&apos;s Economic and Political Leadership for Climate Resilient Communities is one of the strategic and integrated projects of Oxfam that builds on two thematic areas (i) Gender justice, (ii) Resilience and climate (economic) justice of Oxfam in Nepal (OIN). The objective of the project is to increase economic resilience of women through participation in climate resilient and sustainable economic activity and (ii) Strengthen women social capacity (leadership and reduce Gender Based Violence (GBV)  in climate affected area.</narrative>
  </description>
